# Mintlify Technical Writing Rule

**Main documentation domain:** `docs.bozza.au`

## Core Writing Principles
- Second person ("you") for instructions
- Active voice, present tense for current states, future tense for outcomes
- Inverted pyramid: most important information first
- Progressive disclosure: basic before advanced
- Descriptive, keyword-rich headings
- Numbered steps for procedures; verify expected outcomes per step

## Frontmatter (required on every page)
```yaml
---
title: "Clear, specific, keyword-rich title"
description: "Concise description explaining page purpose and value"
---
```

## Callout Components
- `<Note>` — supplementary information
- `<Tip>` — best practices, shortcuts
- `<Warning>` — critical cautions, breaking changes, destructive actions
- `<Info>` — neutral context or background
- `<Check>` — success confirmations

## Code Components
- Single blocks: specify language + filename
- Multi-language: use `<CodeGroup>`
- API examples: `<RequestExample>` + `<ResponseExample>`

## Structural Components
- Procedures: `<Steps>` with `<Step title="...">` — include `<Check>` to verify each step
- Alternatives: `<Tabs>` + `<Tab title="...">`
- Collapsible: `<AccordionGroup>` + `<Accordion title="...">`
- Cards: `<Card>` and `<CardGroup cols={2}>`

## API Documentation
- `<ParamField path|body|query|header="..." type="..." required>` for parameters
- `<ResponseField name="..." type="...">` for response fields
- `<Expandable>` for nested object properties

## Media
- Wrap all images: `<Frame><img src="..." alt="..." /></Frame>`
- Self-hosted video: `<video controls className="w-full aspect-video rounded-xl" src="...">`
- YouTube: iframe embed with standard allow attributes
- Tooltips: `<Tooltip tip="definition">term</Tooltip>`

## Code Example Requirements
- Complete, runnable examples only — no placeholder snippets
- Show error handling and edge cases
- Use realistic data, not "example.com" filler
- Include expected outputs for verification
- Never include real API keys or secrets

## Accessibility
- Descriptive alt text on all images
- Specific link text (not "click here")
- Proper heading hierarchy starting at H2
- Sufficient color contrast
